# Local leak-guard: ALL NBA domain data (schedule/ESPN-odds downloads, parquets,
# price-bearing odds.parquet + odds_snapshots, generated catalogs) stays
# private/untracked. Avoids touching the human-gated root .gitignore (P0-A-001).
# Mirrors the mlb/soccer/tennis nested guards so NBA is protected identically and
# this stays effective independent of the root .gitignore -> nothing here goes public.
*
!.gitignore
